    "title": "ThinkDiag+",
    "description": "Not only for \"ThinkDiag\" and \"ThinkDiag 2\" device, but also works for \"ThinkDiag Mini\", \"ThinkDirver\", \"Thinkcar Pro\" devices.\r\n\r\nThinkDiag, an innovative vehicle diagnostic tool, is specially \r\ndesigned for repair technicians, small and medium-sized repair \r\nshops, and DIYers, to achieve the original manufacturer level \r\ndiagnostic performance. It supports more than 100 vehicle \r\nbrands of diagnostic services, including 15 special maintenance \r\nreset functions. ThinkDiag is as good as those comprehensive \r\ndiagnostic equipment costed thousands of dollars.\r\n\r\nThinkDiag is also an intelligent diagnostic device. Connecting with \r\nsmartphone via Bluetooth, ThinkDiag is controlled to work by APP. \r\nIn the APP, there is a diagnostic software store, and users can \r\npurchase diagnostic software according to their needs through \r\nsubscription. In addition, ThinkDiag also has a remote diagnostic \r\ntechnician side service that quickly connects to ThinkDiag owners to \r\nprovide advice and guide repairs.\r\n\r\n***Contact Us\r\nW: www.mythinkcar.com\r\nE: service@mythinkcar.com\r\nP: +1 833-692-2766 \r\n2151 S Haven Ave Unit 203 \r\nOntario CA 91761 USA",
    "descriptionHTML": "Not only for &quot;ThinkDiag&quot; and &quot;ThinkDiag 2&quot; device, but also works for &quot;ThinkDiag Mini&quot;, &quot;ThinkDirver&quot;, &quot;Thinkcar Pro&quot; devices.<br><br>ThinkDiag, an innovative vehicle diagnostic tool, is specially <br>designed for repair technicians, small and medium-sized repair <br>shops, and DIYers, to achieve the original manufacturer level <br>diagnostic performance. It supports more than 100 vehicle <br>brands of diagnostic services, including 15 special maintenance <br>reset functions. ThinkDiag is as good as those comprehensive <br>diagnostic equipment costed thousands of dollars.<br><br>ThinkDiag is also an intelligent diagnostic device. Connecting with <br>smartphone via Bluetooth, ThinkDiag is controlled to work by APP. <br>In the APP, there is a diagnostic software store, and users can <br>purchase diagnostic software according to their needs through <br>subscription. In addition, ThinkDiag also has a remote diagnostic <br>technician side service that quickly connects to ThinkDiag owners to <br>provide advice and guide repairs.<br><br>***Contact Us<br>W: www.mythinkcar.com<br>E: service@mythinkcar.com<br>P: +1 833-692-2766 <br>2151 S Haven Ave Unit 203 <br>Ontario CA 91761 USA",
